          "section_id": "s10",
          "word_start": 40,
          "word_end": 55,
          "text": "\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd k\u00eanh \u0111\u1ec3 xem c\u01a1 th\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u00f2n gi\u1eef g\u00ec t\u1eeb t\u1ed5 ti\u00ean nh\u00e9.",
